{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6810eb0750f550b778738a11c0f8da807efecf7ed4543af2d0cf5ddab41b1ef3", "ja": "（大きな仕事を頑張ったご褒美に、\n今日は一日、翼と一緒に出かけることになった……）", "zh": "（作为努力完成大工作的奖励，今天要和翼一起出去一整天……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7598eee4af448aae9670a3f04644f5af678c708cd160afb6838e5300c751ee1b", "ja": "ふんふ～ん♪　……えへへ♪", "zh": "哼哼～♪……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8c0e40d7e42418c1cf99d61fbd8cd76cf4ff34888a6574009bccea75997fb73f", "ja": "今日は、ずいぶんご機嫌みたいだな？", "zh": "今天心情似乎特别好啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7a7cab2a1564862cef7b1988b97f12f1ec0daae7d3da8373d774251230ddf0b9", "ja": "だって、うれしいんだもん！　バレンタインに、\n{$P$}さんとデートできるなんて！", "zh": "因为人家很开心嘛！居然能在情人节和{$P$}先生约会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "64f72ff5cd198c1d60f38a1521f5382858ae06d540e445acc903bcd9bea7b5f8", "ja": "わたし、ずーっと憧れてたんです。\n特別な日に、好きな人とデートするの！", "zh": "我一直都很憧憬呢。\n在特别的日子里，和喜欢的人约会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3c616cf0adf8440da366d6e6ce35ce9aae05bf2d498cb0ff20cffdd5cca17d03", "ja": "それに、チョコは絶対渡すって決めてたから。\nちゃんと渡せてよかったなって……えへっ♪", "zh": "而且我早就决定好了，一定要把巧克力送出去。所以能顺利送到你手里，真是太好了……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1006_p", "source_sha256": "467b1e5baaf574ac2c15f23500ee62c4d4b7ba8d65628da55b434a71d987cbcb", "ja": "なるほどな。……あ、もしかして、\n今日出かけたいって言ったのも、このためだったのか？", "zh": "原来如此。……啊，难道你说今天想出门，也是为了这个吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bf30bf33fe905759d1caf930789c08b4f5c49b792ef7404c355b4bd4661c1180", "ja": "そうですよ♪　チョコを渡すなら、\nシチュエーションも大事にしたくて……。", "zh": "没错♪ 如果要送巧克力的话，\n我也想重视一下场合……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d9ab2384852878d679d30b71b1b5b453c12d833148ef23984bed72c9385bad5c", "ja": "本当は夜景の見えるお店で、ふたりきりで……なんて♪\n今のわたしは、オシャレなカフェが限界ですけど。", "zh": "其实我本来想在能看到夜景的店里，两个人单独……什么的♪不过现在的我，最多也只能去时髦的咖啡馆了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "218b346b305c6d368be4a19c354b1e03decdff6193bf8d8ceef365025f1c7de0", "ja": "でもでも、一日デートできるなんて思わなかったから。\nわたし、すっごくうれしいです♪", "zh": "可是，我没想到居然能约会一整天。\n我真的特别开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1010_p", "source_sha256": "aebb39618994ef2206c17983dd6484140ab0a5cfb2fc2e0d9423ffecc2f217fe", "ja": "そんなことを考えてたのか……。突然のプレゼントで\n驚いたけど、でも嬉しかったよ。ありがとうな。", "zh": "原来你在想这些啊……。虽然被这份突如其来的礼物吓了一跳，\n不过我很开心。谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e31beff2236c8b6cdfef80920f08ac02f41d7a99e054a3455f1fd5a1c0250c19", "ja": "えへへ、どういたしまして♪　ちなみに、そのチョコ\nかなり気合い入れて準備したんですけど……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，不用谢♪顺便一提，那个巧克力我可是花了不少心思准备的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ed8d48f1faa64ebc612bb0bc073154d97bc9a8d2875e67660d09537bd2a88867", "ja": "わたしがどこにこだわったか……\n{$P$}さん、わかりますか？", "zh": "我特别讲究的地方是哪里……\n{$P$}先生，你猜得出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1013_p", "source_sha256": "96c9d02b19e9cc6ded01d350069bfbc6cad7c41babb7b2575d15b79335381262", "ja": "翼がこだわったポイントか……。\nうーん……あ！　もしかしてラッピングか？", "zh": "翼特别讲究的地方啊……  \n嗯……啊！难道是包装？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6a506416925721dccde0a45109e721e0e436559191a65d9fad34eac226e2a97f", "ja": "大正～解！　包装紙とかリボンの色とかいっぱい考えて\nすっごくカワイイ感じに仕上げたんです♪", "zh": "完全正确～！包装纸和丝带的颜色我都考虑了好多，\n做得超级可爱哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6a77405deda8aad4b2be5cb22859d758581a38109d9d502cd0ec03ae7a823b23", "ja": "そうだったのか。でも大変だったんじゃないか？\n渡すチョコ、全部にラッピングなんて……。", "zh": "原来是这样。不过一定很辛苦吧？要把要送出去的巧克力全部包装起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ea0dd5d750dedd82f25888347930c878e45daf952f4ac2ba6017307b78768185", "ja": "そんなことないですよ？　いっぱい考えたのは、\n{$P$}さんのだけですから！", "zh": "没那回事哦？我也就认真想了想{$P$}先生的那份而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1017_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "aeb831ed84f2d640b28778aab058e8308a3722d4643995af9b5f7fa80be66dcc", "ja": "だって、{$P$}さんに渡すのは\nわたしの中で一番特別なチョコだもん♪", "zh": "因为要送给{$P$}先生的，是我心里最特别的巧克力嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0374_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e3455b28c05d3cbb35478b560824bde17cc75bc78ac12507a24efa13a9958c9c", "ja": "わたしの好きがいっぱい詰まったプレゼント……\n大切に食べてくださいね！", "zh": "这份礼物里装满了我的喜欢……\n请好好珍惜着吃哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
